#. Developer page: report line when the SDK refused a requested action.
msgctxt "dev_action_declined"
msgid "No change: the SDK declined that action."
msgstr "Sin cambios: el SDK rechazó esa acción."

#. Developer page: note that the action buttons only request changes.
msgctxt "dev_actions_are_requests"
msgid "Actions are requests: confirm them in the measurements and exit rows, which refresh underneath."
msgstr "Las acciones son solicitudes: comprueba su efecto en las mediciones y las filas de salidas, que se actualizan abajo."

#. Developer tools screen (reliability surface): performance-aware affinity control label.
msgctxt "dev_affinity_performance"
msgid "Performance-aware affinity"
msgstr "Afinidad según rendimiento"

#. Developer tools screen: explanatory subtext under the performance-aware affinity control.
msgctxt "dev_affinity_performance_detail"
msgid "Weight new TLS races by each provider's peak acknowledged-byte rate relative to its advertised bandwidth. With hard affinity enabled, low measured donors yield to the race. Existing connections and explicit pins stay fixed"
msgstr "Pondera las nuevas carreras TLS según la tasa máxima de bytes confirmados de cada proveedor en relación con su ancho de banda anunciado. Con la afinidad estricta activada, los proveedores con mediciones bajas ceden ante la carrera. Las conexiones existentes y las fijaciones explícitas no cambian"

#. Developer tools screen (reliability surface): affinity sticky control label.
msgctxt "dev_affinity_sticky"
msgid "Sticky site affinity"
msgstr "Afinidad persistente por sitio"

#. Developer tools screen: explanatory subtext under the 'affinity sticky' control.
msgctxt "dev_affinity_sticky_detail"
msgid "A site's new connections stay on the exit its earlier ones already use, even past the flow cap, so a busy site keeps one egress IP. The cap still limits which exits collect new sites. Off restores the strict cap"
msgstr "Las conexiones nuevas de un sitio se quedan en la salida que ya usan las anteriores, incluso por encima del límite de flujos, para que un sitio con mucho tráfico conserve una sola IP de salida. El límite sigue decidiendo qué salidas aceptan sitios nuevos. Si está desactivado, se restablece el límite estricto"

#. Developer page: what a setting's 0 means when it probes every host ('Probe hosts per pass').
msgctxt "dev_all"
msgid "All"
msgstr "Todos"

#. Developer page: label of the app version row.
msgctxt "dev_app_version"
msgid "App version"
msgstr "Versión de la app"

#. Developer tools screen (reliability surface): behaviour control label.
msgctxt "dev_behaviour"
msgid "Behaviour"
msgstr "Comportamiento"

#. Developer tools screen (reliability surface): blackhole receive control label.
msgctxt "dev_blackhole_receive"
msgid "Keep quiet providers longer"
msgstr "Mantener por más tiempo a los proveedores silenciosos"

#. Developer tools screen: explanatory subtext under the 'blackhole receive' control.
msgctxt "dev_blackhole_receive_detail"
msgid "How long a provider still acknowledging traffic may return nothing before it is dropped. Off keeps them until they stop acknowledging"
msgstr "Cuánto tiempo puede un proveedor que todavía confirma el tráfico no devolver nada antes de descartarlo. Si está desactivado, se mantiene hasta que deje de confirmar"

#. Developer tools screen (reliability surface): blast radius control label.
msgctxt "dev_blast_radius"
msgid "Blast radius"
msgstr "Radio de impacto"

#. Developer tools screen: explanatory subtext under the 'blast radius' control.
msgctxt "dev_blast_radius_detail"
msgid "Connections lost per provider failure. Lower is better"
msgstr "Conexiones perdidas por cada falla de proveedor. Cuanto menos, mejor"

#. Developer tools screen: formatted value readout for 'blast radius'.
msgctxt "dev_blast_radius_value"
msgid "{} per failure"
msgstr "{} por falla"

#. Developer tools screen (reliability surface): busy probe control label.
msgctxt "dev_busy_probe"
msgid "Probe stalled exits before dropping"
msgstr "Sondear las salidas trabadas antes de descartarlas"

#. Developer tools screen (reliability surface): busy probe budget control label.
msgctxt "dev_busy_probe_budget"
msgid "Busy probe wait"
msgstr "Espera de la sonda de ocupación"

#. Developer tools screen: explanatory subtext under the 'busy probe budget' control.
msgctxt "dev_busy_probe_budget_detail"
msgid "How long the stall probe waits for an answer before convicting. Off derives half the stall bar"
msgstr "Cuánto espera la sonda de traba una respuesta antes de condenar. Si está desactivado, se usa la mitad del umbral de traba"

#. Developer tools screen: explanatory subtext under the 'busy probe' control.
msgctxt "dev_busy_probe_detail"
msgid "When an exit stalls, ping it once before convicting. A congested but alive exit answers and keeps its flows; a dead one is still dropped. Off convicts on the stall bar"
msgstr "Cuando una salida se traba, se le hace ping una vez antes de condenarla. Una salida congestionada pero viva responde y conserva sus flujos; una muerta se descarta de todos modos. Si está desactivado, se condena al alcanzar el umbral de traba"

#. Developer page: label of the 'Busy probe wait' setting.
msgctxt "dev_busy_probe_wait"
msgid "Busy probe wait"
msgstr "Espera de la sonda de ocupación"

#. Developer page: the explanation under the 'Busy probe wait' setting.
msgctxt "dev_busy_probe_wait_detail"
msgid "How long the stall probe waits for an answer before convicting, in ms. Off derives half the stall bar"
msgstr "Cuánto espera la sonda de traba una respuesta antes de condenar, en ms. Si está desactivado, se usa la mitad del umbral de traba"

#. Developer tools screen (reliability surface): busy probes control label.
msgctxt "dev_busy_probes"
msgid "Busy probes"
msgstr "Sondas de ocupación"

#. Developer tools screen: explanatory subtext under the 'busy probes' control.
msgctxt "dev_busy_probes_detail"
msgid "Liveness pings fired at stalled exits; acquitted ones answered and were kept, the removals the probe prevented"
msgstr "Pings de actividad enviados a salidas trabadas; las absueltas respondieron y se conservaron: son las eliminaciones que la sonda evitó"

#. Developer tools screen: formatted value readout for 'busy probes'.
msgctxt "dev_busy_probes_value"
msgid "{0} sent / {1} acquitted"
msgstr "{0} enviadas / {1} absueltas"

#. Developer page: button that checks for a new release now. Linux Settings > General: the title of the row whose button does the same.
msgctxt "dev_check_updates"
msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "Buscar actualizaciones"

#. Developer tools screen: action for choosing individual log files to export.
msgctxt "dev_choose_logs"
msgid "Choose logs…"
msgstr "Elegir registros…"

#. Developer tools screen: action that deletes the diagnostics log files without touching local state, preferences or rules.
msgctxt "dev_clear_logs"
